ne-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606182337158649_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606182337158649_720.jpg"> </div><p>【世界杯战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/match1869146date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4分领跑！瑞士4-1十人波黑 巴尔加斯传射曼赞比双响 波黑2轮1分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260619/zhanbao_image_1869146_1781816727_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260619/zhanbao_image_1869146_1781816727_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260619/zhanbao_image_1869146_1781816727_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>瑞士4-1波黑，瑞士4分暂居小组第一。本场曼赞比替补双响，扎卡补时点射，巴尔加斯破门。此役后瑞士暂小组第一。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/match1869143date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">两队皆1平1负！捷克1-1南非 萨迪莱克破门舒尔茨送点莫科纳点射</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260619/zhanbao_image_1869143_1781805178_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260619/zhanbao_image_1869143_1781805178_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260619/zhanbao_image_1869143_1781805178_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>捷克1-1南非。本场过后，双方都是1平1负积1分，捷克排名小组第三，南非垫底。</p><p>【世界杯相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a33af2071febnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA官方世界杯首轮实力榜：梅西进攻第1，雷扎伊扬创造力第1</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.65" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606182314429893.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606182314429893.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606182314429893.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛首轮结束后，FIFA官方推出了实力排行榜，三个关键表现维度中，梅西在进攻维度排名第1，伊朗后卫雷扎伊扬在创造力维度排第1，加拿大后卫科内尔留斯在防守维度排第1。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a343554e86aenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">首支出线队今晨诞生？捷克南非战平 次轮墨西哥韩国胜者将锁定第1</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190224217041.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190224217041_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190224217041_720.jpg"> </div><p>本轮稍后在今晨9点进行的墨西哥对阵韩国的比赛将直接左右小组格局。若两队分出胜负，获胜方将积6分，凭借相互胜负关系提前锁定A组第一。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a3406b331edenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘第二战！巴西足协声明：内马尔不会随队前往费城，专注于康复</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a34088d827bd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a34088d827bd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a34088d827bd.jpg"> </div><p>巴西足协发给多家巴西媒体的声明显示，内马尔不会随队前往费城，专注于康复，无缘对阵海地的世界杯小组赛第二轮比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a3452596676dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿邦拉霍：有些队友可能厌烦C罗了 葡萄牙没有梅西在阿根廷的氛围</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e0825d9c2.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e0825d9c2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e0825d9c2.jpg"> </div><p>talksport消息，阿邦拉霍在节目中谈到了C罗在世界杯首战的表现，以及葡萄牙目前的氛围。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a342f716fe02native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">此前被禁止入境！科特迪瓦官方：瓦希获入境许可，可出战德国</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a32bdaa205fa.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a32bdaa205fa.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a32bdaa205fa.jpg"> </div><p>科特迪瓦官方公告，此前被禁止入境加拿大的瓦希如今已经获得入境许可。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a345bd667b65native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">20岁247天！曼赞比成为世界杯历史最年轻替补双响球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a34584f93c39.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a34584f93c39.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a34584f93c39.jpg"> </div><p>约翰·曼赞比（20岁零247天）替补登场梅开二度。他是世界杯历史上最年轻的单场梅开二度的替补球员。</p><p>【梅西回应父亲病情传闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a341e35b6adanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西团队声明：父亲豪尔赫·梅西病情恢复良好，谴责外界谣言传闻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.82" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190055255866_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.82" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.82" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190055255866_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190055255866_720.jpg"> </div><p>梅西家族发布公告，就近期关于梅西父亲豪尔赫·梅西的病情传闻进行回应。梅西方面称豪尔赫·梅西的病情恢复进展良好，并对近期一些谣言表示谴责。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a3413e7947e5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">截胡纽卡！官方：利物浦签22岁西班牙国脚穆尼奥斯，费用4000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606181627195980.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606181627195980.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606181627195980.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，利物浦签下22岁西班牙国脚边锋穆尼奥斯，据悉球队激活了4000万欧的解约金。利物浦官方表示和穆尼奥斯签署了一份长期合同。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a343a5682a24native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：热刺签下布莱顿后卫范赫克，转会费5200万英镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.72" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190235308229.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190235308229_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/202606190235308229_720.jpg"> </div><p>热刺官方宣布，从布莱顿签下后卫范赫克，转会费5200万英镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a34279d6865anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">上赛季率队夺双冠！官方：国米与主帅齐沃续约至2028年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251210/6939092e5421b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251210/6939092e5421b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251210/6939092e5421b.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，国米与主教练齐沃完成续约，新合同至2028年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-19/6a34376d5c628native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：利物浦告知莱比锡愿总价近1亿欧签迪奥曼德，但对方要1.3亿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260120/696f50d9e887a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260120/696f50d9e887a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260120/696f50d9e887a.jpg"> </div><p>The athletic独家消息，利物浦告知莱比锡愿总价近1亿欧签迪奥曼德，目前是转会战的领跑队伍。利物浦同时也在考虑其他选择。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.